hat when it is searched, all the data will come under the same heading and details and be looked at as one related piece of data.\n\nGOAL:\nTo create a plugin that can split up text across multiple WordPress posts based on form input but the content of each post should have the relevant headers inside the post so all the posts from the original text are then related to each other. The form would be accessible through the WordPress admin area.\n\nPlease create the code and the necessary instructions to create a WordPress plugin that can do this.\n\nThink about this step by step."
